<title>JAPAN: Japan 6-mth T-bill auction lowest price of 99.82.</title>
<headline>Japan 6-mth T-bill auction lowest price of 99.82.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The auction of 1.5 trillion yen of six-month Treasury bills, or &quot;tankoku&quot;, produced the following results, the Ministry of Finance said on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Lowest price     99.820  Stop rate     0.367 pct</p>
<p>Average price    99.821  Average yield 0.364 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   4.1364 trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	1.4997 trillion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 80.1274 pct</p>
<p>Issue date  January 13, 1997</p>
<p>Maturity    July 10, 1997</p>
</text>
